# Belt-and-suspenders root ignores — each subproject also has its own .gitignore
**/node_modules/
**/workdir/
**/.env
**/.playwright-mcp/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/dist/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Per-project run artifacts (JSON/HTML reports) — screenshots and .docx reports are kept
**/reports/*.json
**/reports/*.html
